tal-debt $1.289B vs my\n   $1.254B \u2014 within 3% after leases; (iv) The vendor Q1 \"420bps SBC\n   reduction\" [Unconfirmed] used only directionally; (v) FY2025 diluted\n   shares verified [Actual]; (vi) \"57% market share\" [Estimate - csimarket;\n   low reliability]; (vii) dividend yield vendor fraction 0.44 vs my 0.75%\n   \u2014 vendor granularity; (viii) the Beneish M-score omission is accepted.\nOverall: PASS. No calculation had to be redone.\n\n\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\nSECTION 11. DECISION JOURNAL ENTRY (v2.0)\n\n- T0: 2026-08-24 | Price: $66.71 | Market cap: $5.571B\n- Intrinsic value (prob-weighted): $85.75 | MoS: 22.2% (Adequate)\n- Key assumptions logged: (1) SBC % path 9.1% \u2192 3.2% by 2031;\n  (2) revenue growth 4.6% \u2192 2.0% glide; (3) WACC 9.0%; (4) terminal 2.5%.\n- Red-team concern logged: price above all sell-side targets; adjusted\n  owner cash at 14.7x TTM; MSFT competitive response unmodeled beyond\n  growth glide; balance-sheet fragility in a genuine recession.\n- What would make me wrong: (a) SBC > 6% in 2027 (invalidates the equity\n  engine), (b) revenue growth < 2% in 2027 (bear case activates), (c) a\n  100bps+ jump in 10Y (WACC 10% \u2192 IV $81, still above T0 but MoS fails).\n- Bayesian prior recorded: SBC success prior 50% \u2192 posterior 62% after Q2.\n- Re-mark date: 2027-02-24 (Q4/FY2026 print).\n\n\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u255